  "name": "synfone2",
  "description": "A modular digital signal processing engine and domain-specific language implemented in Rust for real-time audio synthesis. The system features a recursive descent parser that compiles a functional DSL into a graph of signal generators, supporting primitive oscillators, mathematical combinators, and conditional logic. It incorporates a structured binary network protocol for remote control and PCM data transmission, utilizing an internal buffer management system that distinguishes between sample-rate and control-rate processing.",
